WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The final phase of the HOIST simulation. A humanoid keeps its hands near a cable-suspended box above a rectangular landing platform.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The box continues settling toward the platform. Its position and orientation change while the humanoid maintains or adjusts contact.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.800
The final view shows the box's position relative to the landing platform.
